n\": \"Not observed in this example\"", "  }", "}", "```", "", "This example intentionally cannot claim a task or pass a delivery gate. Fill measured", "values and hashes first. For an in-progress claim, confirmed model must be `gpt-6.1-sol`", "and reasoning `high`. For accepted, role is reviewer with a distinct identity, all exact", "task criteria, matching delivery artifacts and passing checks. For done, role is coordinator.", "", "A task requiring semantic acceptance additionally references `semantic_decision`, the", "path of an immutable JSON record with role human_owner or human_reviewer, actor,", "authorization evidence, exact targets/revisions/aspects, basis, decision accepted, and", "decision_artifact pointing to the actual human statement. The tool checks structure and", "hashes; it does not authenticate people. The coordinator must verify the recorded", "authority and scope against the real statement. Model-authored approval is invalid.", "", "```powershell", ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts/workflow.py transition --task IG-1A --to in_progress --evidence private/workflow/runs/IG-1A/attempt-1/claim.json", "```", "", "The example command is for a future executor session. No transition was made to the", "real implementation queue during plan preparation. Synthetic transition tests use", "temporary copies and leave the real queue unchanged."], "truncated": false}

